---
source: tui/src/bottom_pane/list_selection_view.rs
expression: "render_lines_with_width(&view, 80)"
---
                                                                                
  Vim Mode                                                                      
  Choose Enter key behavior for vim mode                                        
                                                                                
  1. Submit in NORMAL         Enter inserts a newline in INSERT mode, submits   
                              in NORMAL mode                                    
  2. Submit in INSERT         Enter submits in INSERT mode, inserts a newline   
                              in NORMAL mode                                    
› 3. Always Submit (current)  Enter submits in both INSERT and NORMAL modes     
  4. Off                      Disable vim mode                                  
                                                                                
  ↑/k ↓/j to navigate, enter to confirm, esc to go back
